  "description": "中文：Shipeng.Foundation 是面向 .NET 10 的基础能力库，提供通用工具、扩展方法、缓存、Redis、MongoDB、SQL、SqlSugar、EF Core、RabbitMQ、MinIO、Excel、Word、二维码、加解密、序列化、分页、树结构、JWT、Swagger/OpenAPI、日志、对象映射、支付、短信和 ASP.NET Core 基础设施集成能力；适合后台管理系统、业务中台、企业应用、微服务和通用 Web API 项目复用。English: Shipeng.Foundation is a .NET 10 foundation library that provides reusable utilities, extension methods, caching, Redis, MongoDB, SQL, SqlSugar, EF Core, RabbitMQ, MinIO, Excel, Word, QR code, cryptography, serialization, pagination, tree structures, JWT, Swagger/OpenAPI, logging, object mapping, payment, SMS, and ASP.NET Core infrastructure integrations for enterprise applications, admin systems, business platforms, microservices, and Web API projects.",
  "id": "Shipeng.Foundation",
  "isPrerelease": false,
